From 2abb1dd212f7d198ee7035db881811fd21565d86 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Senior Matthew <SeniorMatt@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 14:08:51 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 05/12] kcm_kwin_taskswitching: main task switcher on one page,
 alternative switcher and overview on sub-pages
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Page type: Form (docs/page-design.md section 1). Config keys, kcfg, KGlobalAccel, shortcut dialogs and the save() D-Bus
calls are unchanged.

Moved / renamed (inventory/relabel/kcm_kwin_taskswitching.tsv):
- The NavigationTabBar (Task Switcher | Task Switcher (Alternative) | Overview) is gone. The main page is the
  existing TabBoxSettings form (Appearance, Behavior, Configure Shortcuts…) plus a group "Other switchers" with two
  buttons: "Alternative Task Switcher…" (AlternativeSwitcher.qml, same TabBoxSettings with isAlternative) and
  "Overview…" (OverviewPage.qml, the unchanged OverviewSettings form with its Configure Shortcuts / Screen Edges /
  Touchscreen Gestures buttons). The focus-policy message shows on both switcher pages and the controls stay disabled.
- The overview stays here (it is also an effect in Desktop Effects, ia/duplicates.md): moving it out needs the
  manager's call, so only its place in the page changed.
- ksr: markers on the text-only buttons (shortcuts, preview, screen edges, touchscreen, focus warning).

Speed (cause from code, not measured):
- TabBoxLayoutsModel's constructor called load() synchronously: a QDir listing of every plasma/look-and-feel
  directory, a KPackage load and a KConfig read per package, plus KPackage listPackages(KWin/WindowSwitcher) and a
  sort (tabboxlayoutsmodel.cpp:38-80), all before the first frame. It is now queued one event-loop turn later; the
  combo shows "None" for that moment and its currentIndex binding re-runs when the rows arrive (it reads count).
- StackLayout built all three tabs up front (two TabBoxSettings forms with 5 combos each, the overview form with a
  synchronous KGlobalAccel::globalShortcut lookup, kcm.cpp:77). Only the main form is built now; the alternative form
  and the overview (and that lookup) are created when their button is used.
- Numbers: before ~1.6 s under load (ranking only). After: pending, manager will measure.

HIG: HIG-001, HIG-005, HIG-006, HIG-019, HIG-057.

Not built yet (freeze). Unconfirmed: a FormLayout/Form inside ColumnLayout inside SimpleKCM sizing (Kirigami.Form is
new API; both forms use Layout.fillWidth) and the brief "None" flash in the style combo.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01X5N5x9eWzmrq6QYrYLwQnk
